    "note": "Hashes were downloaded from the published v5.23.0 release assets and hashed independently. v5.23.0 fixes a silent abort: install.sh detected versions with `cmd --version | head -1` under `set -euo pipefail`, so a command whose --version prints a banner made head close the pipe, the producer take SIGPIPE, and the whole script die with exit 141 and no output at all -- on any account that already had OpenCode, which is the ordinary update path."
